  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FACE NDC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is the implementation of the formal education component of the FACE NDC which aims to empower all members of the Zambian society to support Zambia&apos;s National Determined Contributions in forestry, agriculture and energy sectors. UNESCO, lead consortium partner, is responsible for implementation of activities with specific focus on formal education to strengthen mainstreaming of climate change education through the review of the national education policy and curriculum development of training materials, There will also be capacity building for pre-service and in-service teacher training with gender responsive pedagogy at all levels of the education system using a blended approach.</narrative>
  </description>
